# Working notes: design records, implementation plans, field measurements and
# the research behind the WeChat automation. They read as the diary of one Mac
# and one WeChat build rather than as documentation, so they stay local.
/docs/
/DUKOU_MACOS_IMPLEMENTATION_RESEARCH.md

# One-off probes used to recover WeChat's export behaviour. The verified
# implementation lives in Sources/ and Tests/; shipping these would ship a
# second, unmaintained automation client beside the app.
/Scripts/wechat-*
/Scripts/verify-wechat-export.py

